    "_note": "Enforceable geometry for hand-authored house SVGs (book/assets/*.svg). The overflow sensor keys its padding threshold off box.text_pad_min_px; design-token-drift gates palette+font membership. Sizes/padding quoted at canvas.reference_width_px; scale proportionally with the viewBox.",
